# Theme & UI stack

## Colors

| Token | Hex | Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| primary-blue | `#042954` | Sidebar background; solid button bg; outline button text/border |
| primary-yellow | `#FFA901` | Icons, accents, highlights |
| text | `#FFFFFF` / `#000000` | White on dark/blue; black on light surfaces |

Prefer these hex values (or matching CSS variables) consistently. Do not invent alternate brand blues/yellows.

### Button variants

1. **Solid** — `bg-[#042954]` + white text
2. **Outline** — white bg + `text-[#042954]` + `border border-[#042954]`

All buttons use a fixed height of **40px** (`h-10`). Do not use taller/shorter button sizes.

### Form fields

All text inputs, selects, and similar form fields use a fixed height of **44px** (`h-11`). Keep field heights consistent across the app.

## Styling

- Use **Tailwind CSS utility classes inline** in JSX (`className="..."`).
- Do **not** add custom CSS modules, styled-components, or separate stylesheet files for component styles (beyond global theme tokens in `app/globals.css` if needed).
- Use **shadcn/ui** for base primitives (Button, Dialog, Input, etc.); wrap/compose them in `components/`.

## Libraries

- Icons: **react-icons** (prefer yellow `#FFA901` for brand icons where appropriate).
- Motion: **framer-motion** for page/section/component transitions and enter/exit animations.
- Charts (dashboards): **recharts** only — do not use other chart libraries.

## Interactions

- Every clickable/actionable control gets `cursor-pointer`.
